Spec: SDDKernel
Purpose: AI-first software engineering workflow with compact notation.
Core:
  protocol = language
  skills = engineering knowledge
  prompts = input candidates
  project = semantic mirror
  tasks = work registry
  chains = execution order
  decisions = approved project choices
  state = current execution state
Source: clean implementation only.
docs: human-readable project knowledge.
AI: read the smallest sufficient context; expand references only when required.
